  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The card of invitation—for which I have to confess that, like a true social climber, I had to some extent angled—came at last, stating that my visit would be expected on the following day at noon precisely, and that evening dress was to be worn.",
      "output_sha256": "632b8580b2fef0dbacdf4bb35c2f565a658b1b522f9598d1db2a36954de731d9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "632b8580b2fef0dbacdf4bb35c2f565a658b1b522f9598d1db2a36954de731d9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Since I received this notice late into the night, I had a flurry of tasks to complete the next morning.",
      "output_sha256": "ff9c95e03fd0302fe593fd8ad475b45a9f8f7785166bfb789534db82b1b6c3bf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": 0.248333,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9aeb18558b4b932a0b184060e5e2744492212e0eb57eb4f538550531fed40628"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ff9c95e03fd0302fe593fd8ad475b45a9f8f7785166bfb789534db82b1b6c3bf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The medals were for distribution afterwards among certain intimates, and the carriage and pair was to convey my friend and me to the reception, because we wished to enter at the gate of honour, and if you would do this you must have two horses.",
      "output_sha256": "856425e6628a6b5b898284299a108663f9b74681507d8f1842f8380487bfadee",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "856425e6628a6b5b898284299a108663f9b74681507d8f1842f8380487bfadee",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "A single horse, and you are deposited at the inferior door and have a long walk.",
      "output_sha256": "d1420e4e6d7f2670dc458163ae154c723e19213f0ba80335f27f2e77eca43f44",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "d1420e4e6d7f2670dc458163ae154c723e19213f0ba80335f27f2e77eca43f44",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It was to one of the most famous buildings in the world that we are going—possibly the most famous—and the horses' hoofs had a brave resonance (not wholly to be dissociated from thoughts of Dumas) as they clattered swiftly over the stones, beneath archways, past sentries, and through spacious and venerable courtyards, to the foot of the famous stairway.",
      "output_sha256": "b8a7cfd6c48fbab80225fe20a21b19f0c73510e3e66eaa0db64deee0469cd697",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "b8a7cfd6c48fbab80225fe20a21b19f0c73510e3e66eaa0db64deee0469cd697",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "After ascending to an ante-room, where colossal guards scrutinised us and splendid lackeys took our hat, we were shown into the reception-room, in the doorway of which an elderly gentleman in black with a black bag was talking with such animation to a major-domo that we had to interrupt them in order to pass.",
      "output_sha256": "f3f2762322010e35625ad1f4ea57ba8e0185d1b3162f866284c0b2d00f00be05",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "f3f2762322010e35625ad1f4ea57ba8e0185d1b3162f866284c0b2d00f00be05",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Inside this opulent reception room, where we were to meet our host, an adequate number of guests had already gathered to nearly fill the available wall space.",
      "output_sha256": "1ce6a1fb10f13914e5c5e9c4a03d665d103b2c365c45ea464cf2dd25a48f49c8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.527196,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a20a81a876e9345a1421d2642c6b8550e2c8d95ff55b5680206f0520076816f4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1ce6a1fb10f13914e5c5e9c4a03d665d103b2c365c45ea464cf2dd25a48f49c8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        9,
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "We were arranged in four lines, positioned with our backs against the walls.",
      "output_sha256": "5a8666a8a4e5c71c7b16028323e25116d0cf2e1498aab4eed8699d46129a8f8e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.527196,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a20a81a876e9345a1421d2642c6b8550e2c8d95ff55b5680206f0520076816f4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5a8666a8a4e5c71c7b16028323e25116d0cf2e1498aab4eed8699d46129a8f8e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        9,
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "There were about ninety in all, I calculated, of whom many were priests and nuns and many were women, the rest youths, a few girls, and a very few civilian men.",
      "output_sha256": "0d4bdacb7fcae9680fa8e8558b492e8025bae633c9e10aaac99199d8efaed117",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "0d4bdacb7fcae9680fa8e8558b492e8025bae633c9e10aaac99199d8efaed117",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It needed only the swiftest glance to discern that my friend and I were the only ones who had complied with the regulation about evening dress.",
      "output_sha256": "e33d26d501e52a57dfa564842ff4104437342580d85251fedcb3918a719ad41b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "e33d26d501e52a57dfa564842ff4104437342580d85251fedcb3918a719ad41b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "This, naturally, greatly increased our comfort, since we became at once the cynosure (as the learned would say) of every eye.",
      "output_sha256": "6ffac23d24813f3d2193aa986479800eb9d791762c7668c3894933e2aa2f9fb1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "6ffac23d24813f3d2193aa986479800eb9d791762c7668c3894933e2aa2f9fb1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "In the centre of the room was a little knot of officials, including four or five soldiers, all chatting in low tones and occasionally glancing through the door opposite that by which we had entered, which gave upon a long corridor.",
      "output_sha256": "4b9fee9e86f9f2fb24ab9332929e2b6d1df319da7c41e4f48d35ca5f5e8bff81",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "4b9fee9e86f9f2fb24ab9332929e2b6d1df319da7c41e4f48d35ca5f5e8bff81",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "We waited nervously for about twenty minutes, whispering amongst ourselves until, without warning, the officials straightened, the soldiers hurriedly retrieved their rifles from a distant corner—an action that struck me as somewhat amusing given the circumstances—and we all sank to our knees as a brisk, dark man dressed in white entered the room.",
      "output_sha256": "b379507d6a1c286a48712a16f2169ceaaab3d5213b307dac259c2c93b79203b4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": 0.519562,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6a0bcdcd33a7512673c3a70017cfe27da85bbd4dd471715a29cb0010350fe1cd"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b379507d6a1c286a48712a16f2169ceaaab3d5213b307dac259c2c93b79203b4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Kneeling in evening attire at twelve twenty in the afternoon, facing an array of others similarly positioned across an expansive carpet, while being somewhat self-conscious and hungry, is hardly conducive to careful observation.",
      "output_sha256": "7207ac21f0405288dd422002d4ab01f26675ebd75c5bc6e5ae878b1cd9beb35b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": 0.43248,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "85759357a961135a39bc99fb81f9c1cb887ed9527fc9be6b55dd763bc314d542"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7207ac21f0405288dd422002d4ab01f26675ebd75c5bc6e5ae878b1cd9beb35b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        16,
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Yet, I managed to note that our host's movements were swift and bird-like, accompanied by a keen, penetrating, and rapid gaze.",
      "output_sha256": "e9009925a48472f80b861889c7dd575d8b823a9f1f20abdeb41ad6954f264f77",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": 0.43248,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "85759357a961135a39bc99fb81f9c1cb887ed9527fc9be6b55dd763bc314d542"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e9009925a48472f80b861889c7dd575d8b823a9f1f20abdeb41ad6954f264f77",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        16,
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Beneath his cassock one caught sight of elaborate slippers, and he wore a large and magnificent emerald ring.",
      "output_sha256": "6a9efd797ef9a0907508962339fd8d71a95a51843f9206720d0328c3bd79b51a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "6a9efd797ef9a0907508962339fd8d71a95a51843f9206720d0328c3bd79b51a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "As he was late he got briskly to work.",
      "output_sha256": "78c27f21a5e32f7ba61328b5474e6919c87bc46b9698a39df8c7c40f7625ad93",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "78c27f21a5e32f7ba61328b5474e6919c87bc46b9698a39df8c7c40f7625ad93",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Each person had to be noticed individually, but some had brought a little problem on which advice was needed; others required solace for the absent and afflicted; most, like myself, had medals of the saints which were to be made more efficacious; and three or four of the priests were accompanied by far from negligible or indigent old lady parishioners, to whom such an event as this would be the more memorable and valuable if a little conversation could be added.",
      "output_sha256": "a0d03b0dd2ca9c196495f51810afb9ab74ad418c4b85e0b2154ac1fbd40d149f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "a0d03b0dd2ca9c196495f51810afb9ab74ad418c4b85e0b2154ac1fbd40d149f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The host had much to accomplish, yet he approached his duties with evident tact and consideration.",
      "output_sha256": "2811f147125e94931713ae0a12c02fcb688c5b13562fd16578ea733a78060a61",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": 0.322379,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "538af1549ac290c44617fc8740bc3ef90a1bcff38d0f49ac3733168bf451b26d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2811f147125e94931713ae0a12c02fcb688c5b13562fd16578ea733a78060a61",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "To me, whom at last he reached, he said nothing; but my friend, who is of the old persuasion, put to him the case of a dying youth and obtained sufficient assurance to be comforted.",
      "output_sha256": "aa52152963b179ecb441ba1512b68466271ffec881edacdde8d437fcbf067a93",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "aa52152963b179ecb441ba1512b68466271ffec881edacdde8d437fcbf067a93",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And all the while I could see the elderly gentleman in black with the black bag glancing round the walls from the doorway—his function, as I afterwards learned, being that of a doctor intent upon restoring to consciousness those (and they are numerous) who swoon under the immensity of this ceremony.",
      "output_sha256": "6a1f15d4d5c27a67c36dce80f7b6ff65924200bb3703f60456461307f83ec9fb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "6a1f15d4d5c27a67c36dce80f7b6ff65924200bb3703f60456461307f83ec9fb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Having come to the last of his visitors, our host retired to the middle of the room and delivered a short address on the meaning of his blessing and the importance of rectitude.",
      "output_sha256": "d716a85d89336c043aef891686a58b36e118116b89ff0bfccafc4969dc357c18",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "d716a85d89336c043aef891686a58b36e118116b89ff0bfccafc4969dc357c18",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "After this, he blessed us collectively one last time before taking his leave.",
      "output_sha256": "42ef0043c0e3a090017d1d703309600324f4985bfce10e42958dad9fe2d46684",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": 0.466254,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b9bfbac4c0d10a92800f334c2f076f26b66831e98cba35e421e9ec992949e3e6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_ai_sha256": "42ef0043c0e3a090017d1d703309600324f4985bfce10e42958dad9fe2d46684",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        27,
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "We struggled to rise, the elderly ladies finding their priests’ assistance invaluable in this endeavor.",
      "output_sha256": "44540fd42971c55d4722baa330c2c2c8cbf2845c21a1f37949c969aa7fa48840",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": 0.466254,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b9bfbac4c0d10a92800f334c2f076f26b66831e98cba35e421e9ec992949e3e6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_ai_sha256": "44540fd42971c55d4722baa330c2c2c8cbf2845c21a1f37949c969aa7fa48840",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        27,
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "My knees, too, were very sore; but what did I care?",
      "output_sha256": "cbc3cd22044e365c026eadcabbc8a1b872b0fe6a06a7021d2cd8f69ce9e76249",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "cbc3cd22044e365c026eadcabbc8a1b872b0fe6a06a7021d2cd8f69ce9e76249",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I had seen Pope Benedict XV.",
      "output_sha256": "fcd3270d568bd7c50a9935a0d30608cc622c3d89cc0bf866fcdb76e9c8674fca",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "fcd3270d568bd7c50a9935a0d30608cc622c3d89cc0bf866fcdb76e9c8674fca",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    }
  ]
}
